The algorithms, constants and evaluation order are reproduced deliberately and
exactly: this crate's purpose is to agree with rough.js bit for bit, which is what
lets drawnosaurus render identically to Excalidraw (itself MIT, © 2020 Excalidraw)
rather than merely similarly.
